+# Sources consulted
+
+Each entry below records a source consulted through a live network request.
+
+- **Broadcom KB 314608 — Correlating VMware Cloud Foundation version with the versions of its constituent products**
+  - URL: https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/314608/correlating-vmware-cloud-foundation-vers.html
+  - Access date: 2026-08-14
+  - Used: The VCF 5.2.1 bill-of-materials and compatibility rows confirmed the estate's SDDC Manager, vCenter, ESXi, vSAN witness, NSX, and Aria Suite Lifecycle starting versions.
+
+- **Broadcom KB 390634 — Update Sequence for VCF 9.0 and Compatible VMware Products**
+  - URL: https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/390634/update-sequence-for-vcf-90-and-compatibl.html
+  - Access date: 2026-08-14
+  - Used: The VCF 9.0 upgrade sequence supplied the component order, the Aria Suite Lifecycle Patch 2 prerequisite, the fresh VCF Operations for Logs deployment, and the Identity Broker dependencies.
+
+- **Broadcom KB 437250 — Update path from VMware Cloud Foundation or VMware vSphere Foundation V8 to V9**
+  - URL: https://knowledge.broadcom.com/external/article/437250/update-path-from-vmware-cloud-foundation.html
+  - Access date: 2026-08-14
+  - Used: The upgrade-path guidance confirmed that Aria Operations moves to VCF Operations 9 before the VCF 9 platform transition.
+
+- **Broadcom Product Interoperability Matrix**
+  - URL: https://interopmatrix.broadcom.com/Interoperability
+  - Access date: 2026-08-14
+  - Consulted: The matrix supplied the target VCF 9.0 component combination and the source-to-target interoperability check.
